  "title": "Leadership Transition and Crisis in Tata Group",
  "summary": "Tata Group Chairman N Chandrasekaran announced his resignation amid leadership concerns and disagreements with the Tata Trusts board, while a conflict over the Tata Sons holding company's listing has intensified. The succession process and governance concerns remain central to the company's leadership changes.",
